{"step_index":95,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:45:34Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nImprove the existing StreamWave Entertainment interface without rebuilding the project or changing its working FastAPI backend.\r\n\r\nFirst inspect the current files and understand how the interface, catalogue API, filtering, media details, playback and event logging work. Preserve all existing API endpoints, data structures, tests, Vercel configuration and working functionality.\r\n\r\nMake only the following interface improvements:\r\n\r\n1. PLAYBACK LABELS\r\n\r\n* Movie cards must display “Watch Preview”.\r\n* Music cards must display “Play Sample”.\r\n* The featured-content button must use the correct label according to its media type.\r\n* Do not use “Play Demo” on every card.\r\n* If multiple catalogue items use the same generated demonstration file, show a discreet “Technical sample” label and do not imply that copyrighted content is being streamed.\r\n\r\n2. HEADER\r\n\r\n* Reduce the visual size of the “Serverless Demonstration” badge.\r\n* Keep it visible because it is important for the academic assessment.\r\n* Replace the primary “API Docs” navigation link with a smaller “Developer” link or menu that opens `/docs`.\r\n* Maintain a clean, balanced desktop header.\r\n* Ensure the header works properly on tablets and mobile phones.\r\n\r\n3. MEDIA CARDS\r\n\r\n* Allow long titles to occupy a maximum of two lines instead of cutting them off too early.\r\n* Add a tooltip or title attribute containing the complete title.\r\n* Make the cover image and title clickable.\r\n* Add subtle professional hover and keyboard-focus states.\r\n* Keep one clear primary playback button and one secondary details button.\r\n* Maintain equal card heights within each row.\r\n* Do not add excessive rounded corners, glass effects, glowing borders or unnecessary gradients.\r\n\r\n4. AUDIO PLAYER\r\n\r\n* Ensure the fixed bottom player never covers catalogue cards or footer content.\r\n* Add sufficient bottom padding to the page.\r\n* Display the selected track’s title, artist and cover thumbnail.\r\n* Show a helpful “Select a track to play” state before a selection is made.\r\n* Include play/pause, timeline, volume and accessible control labels.\r\n* On mobile, stack the metadata and player controls cleanly.\r\n* Add an optional minimise button if it improves the mobile layout.\r\n\r\n5. RESPONSIVE DESIGN\r\n\r\n* Use four catalogue columns on large desktop screens.\r\n* Use three columns on medium desktops.\r\n* Use two columns on tablets.\r\n* Use one column on small mobile screens.\r\n* Make the featured section, search box, filters, navigation and player responsive.\r\n* Prevent horizontal scrolling at all supported screen widths.\r\n\r\n6. ACCESSIBILITY\r\n\r\n* Add visible `:focus-visible` indicators.\r\n* Ensure buttons have meaningful accessible names.\r\n* Ensure modal focus is managed correctly.\r\n* Allow the details modal to close using Escape.\r\n* Ensure text has sufficient contrast against the dark background.\r\n* Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.\r\n* Use semantic HTML headings, navigation, buttons and labels.\r\n\r\n7. CONTENT AND ACADEMIC CLARITY\r\n\r\n* Add a small footer statement explaining that the application is a non-commercial academic serverless prototype.\r\n* State that displayed media metadata and generated samples are used for demonstration.\r\n* Do not add or download copyrighted music, film clips or images.\r\n* Do not invent streaming rights or partnerships.\r\n\r\n8. VISUAL STYLE\r\n\r\n* Preserve the dark graphite, white and restrained red StreamWave colour scheme.\r\n* Maintain the current Zimbabwean entertainment focus.\r\n* Use strong typography, consistent spacing and clean rectangular cards.\r\n* Make the result look like a credible entertainment platform rather than a generic AI-generated dashboard.\r\n* Do not replace the interface with a template or introduce a frontend framework.\r\n\r\n9. VERIFICATION\r\n\r\n* Test search, media-type filtering, genre filtering, details modal, audio playback and navigation.\r\n* Confirm that the correct button label is generated for each media type.\r\n* Test desktop, tablet and mobile layouts.\r\n* Run all existing automated tests.\r\n* Fix any regression introduced by the interface changes.\r\n* Do not report success unless the tests and manual checks have actually been completed.\r\n\r\nWhen finished, provide:\r\n\r\n1. The files changed.\r\n2. A concise explanation of each improvement.\r\n3. Actual automated test results.\r\n4. Manual interface checks completed.\r\n5. Any remaining limitations.\r\n\r\nDo not modify the FastAPI architecture or deployment approach unless a change is strictly required to fix a verified interface problem.\r\n\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-25T17:45:34+02:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:45:34Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Interface Requirements**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's request to refine the StreamWave interface. The goal is clear: enhance it without a full overhaul or backend modifications. Right now, I'm carefully reviewing the nine specific requirements, starting with the playback labels, to better understand the scope and constraints of this task.\n\n\n**Refining Card Display**\n\nI've just focused on media cards, optimizing title display for longer names using two-line truncation and tooltips. Added clickable elements for the cover and title, and included hover/focus states to meet UI standards. The primary goal is to provide a good user experience on the new interface, which includes keeping equal card heights and avoiding needless visual embellishments.\n\n\n**Implementing Responsive Layout**\n\nI'm now focusing on responsiveness, planning a four-column layout for large desktops, scaling down to a single column on small mobile screens. I'll ensure horizontal scrolling is prevented across all devices. Accessibility considerations, such as visible focus indicators and accessible names, are next on my list, including a modal focus trap. Semantic HTML elements are also a priority.\n\n\n**Examining Index.html Structure**\n\nI'm now diving deep into `index.html`. It's a structured approach, scrutinizing the header with the StreamWave logo and essential links like Home, Catalogue, and a developer link. The hero will showcase *Cook Off* with a \"Watch Preview\" button. I'm also planning the main section's toolbar, state containers for loading and errors, the details modal's accessibility, and the audio player's controls. Finally, the footer needs non-commercial prototype details and metadata.\n\n\n**Styling Responsive Grid**\n\nI've just refined the CSS for the grid layout. I've defined a responsive grid that scales down from four columns on larger screens to a single column on the smallest ones. I'm also ensuring equal card heights using flexbox, implementing a two-line title clamp, and making cover images and titles clickable. I've also incorporated accessible focus styles and reduced motion preferences, and ensured a bottom padding on the body, so the audio player bar doesn't obscure content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Entertainment | Serverless Media Platform</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#featured\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <span class=\"logo-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▶</span>\n                <span class=\"logo-text\">StreamWave <span class=\"logo-accent\">Entertainment</span></span>\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#featured\" class=\"nav-link active\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#catalogue\" class=\"nav-link\">Catalogue</a>\n                <a href=\"/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"nav-link developer-link\" title=\"Open API Documentation in Swagger\">\n                    Developer <span class=\"ext-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"serverless-badge-sm\" title=\"Non-commercial academic serverless deployment\">\n                <span class=\"pulse-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span>Serverless Demo</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n        <!-- Hero / Featured Content Section -->\n        <section id=\"featured\" class=\"hero-section\" aria-label=\"Featured Media Release\">\n            <div class=\"hero-backdrop\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-tag-group\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-tag\">FEATURED ZIMBABWEAN RELEASE</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">Technical Sample</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\" title=\"Cook Off (2017)\">Cook Off</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>2017</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>Comedy / Romance</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>1h 41m</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">\n                    An uplifting Zimbabwean romantic comedy following Anesu, a single mother in Harare who enters a high-stakes national cooking competition against all odds.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.playMedia('1')\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎬</span> Watch Preview\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.openDetails('1')\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ</span> View Details\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Catalogue Filter & Search Section -->\n        <section id=\"catalogue\" class=\"catalogue-section\" aria-label=\"Media Catalogue\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Media Catalogue</h2>\n                <span class=\"item-count\" id=\"item-count\">Loading...</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Controls Toolbar -->\n            <div class=\"toolbar\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Catalogue Search and Filtering Controls\">\n                <div class=\"search-box\">\n                    <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</span>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-input\" placeholder=\"Search title, artist, director, or genre...\" aria-label=\"Search media catalogue\">\n                    <button id=\"clear-search\" class=\"clear-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear search query\" style=\"display: none;\">✕</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"filter-group\">\n                    <!-- Type Filter Tabs -->\n                    <div class=\"type-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter media by type\">\n                        <button class=\"type-tab active\" data-type=\"\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">All</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"movie\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Movies</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"music\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Music</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Genre Dropdown -->\n                    <div class=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select id=\"genre-select\" aria-label=\"Filter media by genre\">\n                            <option value=\"\">All Genres</option>\n                            <option value=\"Comedy\">Comedy</option>\n                            <option value=\"Drama\">Drama</option>\n                            <option value=\"Action\">Action</option>\n                            <option value=\"Zimdancehall\">Zimdancehall</option>\n                            <option value=\"Afro-pop\">Afro-pop</option>\n                            <option value=\"Traditional\">Traditional</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- UI States Container -->\n            <div id=\"state-container\">\n                <!-- Loading State -->\n                <div id=\"loading-state\" class=\"state-view\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading content\"></div>\n                    <p>Loading Zimbabwean media catalogue...</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Error State -->\n                <div id=\"error-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</div>\n                    <h3>Failed to Load Media</h3>\n                    <p id=\"error-message\">Unable to fetch media catalogue from serverless backend.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.fetchMedia()\">Try Again</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty State -->\n                <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</div>\n                    <h3>No Media Found</h3>\n                    <p>No titles match your current search and filter criteria.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.resetFilters()\">Reset Filters</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Media Cards Grid -->\n                <div id=\"media-grid\" class=\"media-grid\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Statement for Academic & Content Clarity -->\n    <footer class=\"app-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <span class=\"logo-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▶</span> StreamWave Entertainment\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n                <strong>Non-Commercial Academic Prototype</strong> • Built with Python 3.12, FastAPI, and Vercel Serverless Functions.\n                Media titles and metadata are presented for Zimbabwean cultural demonstration purposes. Audio playback relies on an original, synthesized demonstration chime. No copyrighted music or film files are hosted or transmitted.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Accessible Media Details Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"details-dialog\" class=\"details-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"dialog-desc\">\n        <div class=\"dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-dialog\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close details modal\">✕</button>\n            <div id=\"dialog-body\" class=\"dialog-body\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Content Injected via JS -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-- Fixed HTML5 Audio Player Bar -->\n    <aside id=\"audio-player-bar\" class=\"audio-player-bar\" aria-label=\"Audio Player Controls\">\n        <div class=\"player-container\">\n            <button id=\"player-toggle-btn\" class=\"player-toggle-btn\" aria-label=\"Minimize audio player\" title=\"Minimize player\">▼</button>\n            \n            <div class=\"player-track-info\">\n                <div class=\"track-thumb\" id=\"player-thumb\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎵</div>\n                <div class=\"track-text\">\n                    <div class=\"track-title\" id=\"player-title\">Select a track to play</div>\n                    <div class=\"track-artist\" id=\"player-artist\">StreamWave Audio Player</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"player-controls\">\n                <audio id=\"html5-audio\" controls preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"Media Audio Player\">\n                    <source id=\"audio-source\" src=\"\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n                    Your browser does not support HTML5 audio playback.\n                </audio>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"player-status\" id=\"event-log-badge\">\n                <span class=\"event-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span id=\"event-log-text\">Ready</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <script src=\"/js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update index.html with accessible structure, discreet badges, developer link, and academic disclaimer footer","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\public\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating public/index.html","toolSummary":"Updating public/index.html"}}]}
